«
@@ ============================================================
@@ σRFxjxi — propagation of uncertainty through a function of
@@ several variables, by the law of propagation of the GUM.
@@
@@ Input:  'F' Xn … X2 X1, where F is an expression of the names
@@         x1, x2, … xn, and each Xj is the value of xj: a±σb, a
@@         plain number (exact), with or without units; X1 is on
@@         the first level.
@@ Output: F(X1 … Xn) as Y±σu.
@@ Correlations: none, unless a global variable ρij holds either
@@ one coefficient for all pairs, or the full correlation matrix
@@ (n×n, in the order x1 … xn).
@@ Method: each contribution cj = ∂F/∂xj·σj is obtained by five
@@ point central differences on the values with their units, with
@@ a step of σj/1000, so that it comes out in the unit of F; then
@@ u² = Σ ci·cj·ρij. Works with constants, angles and any units.
@@ Author & design          : Jean Wilson
@@ Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
@@ ============================================================

  @ Find F: the first expression down the stack
  0
  Depth 1 - 1 Swap For j
    If Dup 0 == Then
      If j 1 + Pick TypeName "expression" == Then Drop j End
    End
  Next
  If Dup 1 ≤ Then "σRFxjxi: an expression F, then its values" DoError End
  1 -
  → nv
  «
    nv →List Swap
    → vls fx
    «
      @ Check that F uses x1 … xn
      0
      { } 1 nv For j 0 + Next
      'fx' Rcl XVars
      → nms lnm
      «
        1 lnm Size For kk
          lnm kk Get Dup →Text
          → ev etx
          «
            1 30 For j
              If etx "x" j →Text + == etx "'x" j →Text + "'" + == Or Then
                j Max
                If j nv ≤ Then nms j 'ev' Rcl Put 'nms' Store End
              End
            Next
          »
        Next
        nms
      »
      Swap
      If nv ≠ Then "σRFxjxi: F and the number of values differ" DoError End
      → nms
      «

      @ Central values, standard uncertainties and the list x1 v1 … xn vn
      { } { } { }
      → l0 vs ss
      «
        1 nv For j
          vls nv j - 1 + Get
          → xv
          «
            0 0
            If xv TypeName "unit" == Then
              Drop Drop
              1 xv →Unit xv UVal
              If Dup TypeName "uncertain" == Then
                Explode 3 Pick * Swap 3 Pick * Swap Rot Drop
              Else
                * 0
              End
            Else
              Drop Drop
              If xv TypeName "uncertain" == Then xv Explode Else xv 0 End
            End
            → cv sv
            «
              l0 nms j Get + cv + 'l0' Store
              vs cv + 'vs' Store
              ss sv + 'ss' Store
            »
          »
        Next

        @ The value of F, and one contribution per uncertain variable
        'fx' Rcl l0 Where →Num
        { }
        → y0c cs
        «
          1 nv For j
            ss j Get
            → sv
            «
              If sv 0 == Then
                @ A zero in the unit of F, so that the sums below stay consistent
                cs y0c 0 * + 'cs' Store
              Else
                sv 1000 /
                → hs
                «
                  @ Five point central difference, as Christophe wrote it:
                  @ (8·(F(x+h)−F(x−h)) + (F(x−2h)−F(x+2h)))/(12·h), times σ = 1000·h
                  'fx' Rcl l0 2 j * vs j Get hs + Put Where →Num
                  'fx' Rcl l0 2 j * vs j Get hs - Put Where →Num
                  - 8 *
                  'fx' Rcl l0 2 j * vs j Get 2 hs * - Put Where →Num
                  'fx' Rcl l0 2 j * vs j Get 2 hs * + Put Where →Num
                  - +
                  1000 * 12 /
                  cs Swap + 'cs' Store
                »
              End
            »
          Next

          @ u² = Σ ci·cj·ρij
          0
          IfErr 'ρij' Rcl Then Drop 0 End
          → ro
          «
            @ A matrix left from an earlier call must match the variables
            If ro TypeName "array" == Then
              If ro Size 1 Get nv ≠ Then
                "σRFxjxi: the size of ρij differs from the number of variables" DoError
              End
            End
            1 nv For i
              1 nv For j
                cs i Get cs j Get *
                If i j ≠ Then
                  If ro TypeName "list" == ro TypeName "array" == Or
                  Then ro { } i + j + Get
                  Else ro End
                  *
                Else
                  1 *
                End
                +
              Next
            Next
          »
          √
          → uq
          «
            If y0c TypeName "unit" == Then
              1 y0c →Unit
              → yu
              «
                y0c UVal
                If uq TypeName "unit" == Then uq yu Convert UVal Else uq End
                →σRange yu →Unit
              »
            Else
              y0c uq UVal →σRange
            End
          »
        »
      »
      »
    »
  »
»
